lign: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/1/f3167ac677c634929751f659fd94a2710041fc1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$651$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/0/1c0b1a85c99ce319b894134f01ed5b80fa5ddc6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$654$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> works. So now we have, as possibilities, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/b/10b8a4057e2b803f0f1578e1d1833c1ce5826dff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab1654$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/0/6206e2462adbe192a1c24457c84729462b14a5de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab3651$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/b/0ab6454edeea1adbe89a8142ea3223a7de9e76d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab3654$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"13\" />. But clearly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/0/6206e2462adbe192a1c24457c84729462b14a5de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab3651$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> can't work, as we need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/c/76c84f7ee6833ea13782445dfd147c97a98e03f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abcdef$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" /> to be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so it must be even, so we eliminate this possibility. Now with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/b/10b8a4057e2b803f0f1578e1d1833c1ce5826dff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab1654$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" />, we need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> to be even, so it must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/c/61cd21bc650303dfb878f398b4eb9480f529f8a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a21654$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />, and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/c/5dceec46d3b6c608cbcbd0eb441488f57bf711fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$321654$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" /> works as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> does divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/9691986bc20f256cdd5f2a7c316ddaa8db873e6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$321$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />. With <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/b/0ab6454edeea1adbe89a8142ea3223a7de9e76d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab3654$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"13\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23fe9198bd28f3b5bf81c63effaa7eea18d663e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a23654$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is even, and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/2/942c794c45e3a266fe2169c4adfa8e884162faab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$123654$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" /> works as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e25f7c53c416ec43ea033a38f680639c5bcfe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$123$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />. Hence the number of such numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/c/5dceec46d3b6c608cbcbd0eb441488f57bf711fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$321654$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/2/942c794c45e3a266fe2169c4adfa8e884162faab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$123654$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME\" title=\"1991 AHSME\">1991 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991